# Copy to <project>/.github/CODEOWNERS and set real owners.
#
# Combined with branch protection ("Require a pull request before merging" +
# "Require review from Code Owners"), every change under specs/ — including
# flipping a spec to "Status: APPROVED" — needs an owner-reviewed PR.
# This is what makes the APPROVED line trustworthy: the spec-gate hook and the
# lifecycle skills only read it; CODEOWNERS + the spec-approval-guard CI job
# enforce who can write it.

/specs/ @your-org/spec-approvers
